{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-1","name":"プロデューサー","text":"はるき、チケットもらったんだ","trans":"阳希，我拿到票了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"今日このあとよかったらどうだ？","trans":"今天之后要是方便，去不去？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001001110010","name":"はるき","text":"わ……！\r\nいいんですか？","trans":"哇……！\n可以吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001001110020","name":"はるき","text":"……なんのチケットでしょう？","trans":"……是什么的票呢？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001001110030","name":"はるき","text":"わぁっ……！\r\n面白そう～","trans":"哇啊……！\n好像很有趣～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001001110040","name":"はるき","text":"早く行きましょう、プロデューサーさん……！","trans":"我们快去看看吧，制作人……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001001110050","name":"はるき","text":"あ……最近、映画行ったばかりで……！","trans":"啊……我最近刚去看过电影……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001001110060","name":"はるき","text":"なんの映画ですかね……？","trans":"是什么电影呢……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001001110070","name":"はるき","text":"犬……ですか……！","trans":"狗……吗……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001001110080","name":"はるき","text":"でも……\r\n近寄ってきてくれないと寂しいですよね……","trans":"不过……\n要是不肯靠过来的话，会有点寂寞呢……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}